{"seq":1,"slug":"data-types-and-ddl","title":"数据类型与 DDL","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/sql-language/sql-fundamentals/data-types-and-ddl","wordCount":967,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"数据类型与-ddl\">数据类型与 DDL</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>SQL（Structured Query Language）的数据定义语言（DDL）是构建数据库结构的基础。DDL 负责创建、修改和删除数据库对象——表、索引、视图和约束。理解数据类型是编写高效 SQL 的前提：选择合适的数据类型不仅影响存储效率，还直接决定查询性能和数据完整性。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[DDL 操作] --&gt; B[CREATE]&#10;    A --&gt; C[ALTER]&#10;    A --&gt; D[DROP]&#10;    A --&gt; E[TRUNCATE]&#10;&#10;    B --&gt; B1[CREATE TABLE]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[CREATE INDEX]&#10;    B --&gt; B3[CREATE VIEW]&#10;&#10;    C --&gt; C1[ADD COLUMN]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[MODIFY COLUMN]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[DROP COLUMN]&#10;&#10;    subgraph 数据完整性&#10;        F[PRIMARY KEY]&#10;        G[FOREIGN KEY]&#10;        H[UNIQUE]&#10;        I[CHECK]&#10;        J[NOT NULL]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    A[DDL 操作] --&gt; B[CREATE]\n    A --&gt; C[ALTER]\n    A --&gt; D[DROP]\n    A --&gt; E[TRUNCATE]\n\n    B --&gt; B1[CREATE TABLE]\n    B --&gt; B2[CREATE INDEX]\n    B --&gt; B3[CREATE VIEW]\n\n    C --&gt; C1[ADD COLUMN]\n    C --&gt; C2[MODIFY COLUMN]\n    C --&gt; C3[DROP COLUMN]\n\n    subgraph 数据完整性\n        F[PRIMARY KEY]\n        G[FOREIGN KEY]\n        H[UNIQUE]\n        I[CHECK]\n        J[NOT NULL]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据类型分类</th>\n<th>常用类型</th>\n<th>存储大小</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>整数</td>\n<td>INT / BIGINT / SMALLINT</td>\n<td>2-8 字节</td>\n<td>ID、计数、状态码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>浮点数</td>\n<td>DECIMAL / FLOAT / DOUBLE</td>\n<td>4-16 字节</td>\n<td>金额用 DECIMAL，科学计算用 FLOAT</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>字符串</td>\n<td>VARCHAR / TEXT / CHAR</td>\n<td>可变</td>\n<td>VARCHAR 用于变长文本，CHAR 用于定长编码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日期时间</td>\n<td>DATE / TIMESTAMP / INTERVAL</td>\n<td>4-8 字节</td>\n<td>时间戳、日期范围</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>布尔</td>\n<td>BOOLEAN</td>\n<td>1 字节</td>\n<td>开关标志</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二进制</td>\n<td>BLOB / BYTEA</td>\n<td>可变</td>\n<td>文件、图片（通常建议外部存储）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>JSON</td>\n<td>JSON / JSONB</td>\n<td>可变</td>\n<td>半结构化数据（PostgreSQL JSONB 支持索引）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"数值类型精度选择\">数值类型精度选择</h2><p>数值类型的选择是最容易犯错的地方。FLOAT 和 DOUBLE 使用 IEEE 754 浮点表示，存在精度损失问题，在金融等对精度要求严格的场景中必须使用 DECIMAL（也称 NUMERIC）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// DECIMAL vs FLOAT 的精度差异&#10;// DECIMAL(10, 2) — 精确存储，适合金额&#10;// FLOAT — 近似存储，0.1 + 0.2 可能不等于 0.3&#10;&#10;// 正确的金额字段定义&#10;const createOrderTable = `&#10;CREATE TABLE orders (&#10;    order_id    BIGINT GENERATED ALWAYS AS IDENTITY PRIMARY KEY,&#10;    user_id     BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;    amount      DECIMAL(12, 2) NOT NULL CHECK (amount &gt;= 0),&#10;    discount    DECIMAL(5, 4) DEFAULT 0.0000,&#10;    created_at  TIMESTAMP WITH TIME ZONE DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP&#10;);&#10;`;&#10;&#10;// 错误示范：用 FLOAT 存储金额&#10;// CREATE TABLE orders (amount FLOAT) — 会导致精度丢失\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// DECIMAL vs FLOAT 的精度差异</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// DECIMAL(10, 2) — 精确存储，适合金额</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// FLOAT — 近似存储，0.1 + 0.2 可能不等于 0.3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 正确的金额字段定义</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> createOrderTable</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">CREATE TABLE orders (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    order_id    BIGINT GENERATED ALWAYS AS IDENTITY PRIMARY KEY,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    user_id     BIGINT NOT NULL,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    amount      DECIMAL(12, 2) NOT NULL CHECK (amount >= 0),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    discount    DECIMAL(5, 4) DEFAULT 0.0000,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    created_at  TIMESTAMP WITH TIME ZONE DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 错误示范：用 FLOAT 存储金额</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// CREATE TABLE orders (amount FLOAT) — 会导致精度丢失</span></span></code></pre></div><p>整数类型的选择影响存储效率和范围。SMALLINT（2字节，±32767）适合枚举值和状态码，INT（4字节，±21亿）覆盖大部分场景，BIGINT（8字节）用于大规模 ID 生成：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>字节</th>\n<th>最大值</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>SMALLINT</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>32,767</td>\n<td>状态码、枚举</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>INT</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>2,147,483,647</td>\n<td>普通 ID、计数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BIGINT</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>9.2 × 10^18</td>\n<td>雪花 ID、大表主键</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DECIMAL(p,s)</td>\n<td>可变</td>\n<td>精确到 p 位</td>\n<td>金额、费率</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"表创建与约束体系\">表创建与约束体系</h2><p>表创建不仅是定义列和类型，更重要的是通过约束（Constraints）保证数据完整性。约束是数据库层面的防御机制，比应用层验证更可靠。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const createUserTable = `&#10;CREATE TABLE users (&#10;    user_id     BIGINT GENERATED ALWAYS AS IDENTITY PRIMARY KEY,&#10;    email       VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL UNIQUE,&#10;    username    VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL,&#10;    status      SMALLINT NOT NULL DEFAULT 1 CHECK (status IN (0, 1, 2)),&#10;    created_at  TIMESTAMP WITH TIME ZONE DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,&#10;    updated_at  TIMESTAMP WITH TIME ZONE DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,&#10;    &#10;    CONSTRAINT chk_email_format &#10;        CHECK (email ~* &#39;^[A-Za-z0-9._%+-]+@[A-Za-z0-9.-]+\\\\.[A-Za-z]{2,}$&#39;)&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE user_profiles (&#10;    profile_id  BIGINT GENERATED ALWAYS AS IDENTITY PRIMARY KEY,&#10;    user_id     BIGINT NOT NULL UNIQUE,&#10;    bio         TEXT,&#10;    avatar_url  VARCHAR(500),&#10;    &#10;    CONSTRAINT fk_user &#10;        FOREIGN KEY (user_id) REFERENCES users(user_id) &#10;        ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE&#10;);&#10;`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> createUserTable</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">CREATE TABLE users (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    user_id     BIGINT GENERATED ALWAYS AS IDENTITY PRIMARY KEY,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    email       VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL UNIQUE,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    username    VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    status      SMALLINT NOT NULL DEFAULT 1 CHECK (status IN (0, 1, 2)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    created_at  TIMESTAMP WITH TIME ZONE DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    updated_at  TIMESTAMP WITH TIME ZONE DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    CONSTRAINT chk_email_format </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        CHECK (email ~* '^[A-Za-z0-9._%+-]+@[A-Za-z0-9.-]+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\\</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.[A-Za-z]{2,}$')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">CREATE TABLE user_profiles (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    profile_id  BIGINT GENERATED ALWAYS AS IDENTITY PRIMARY KEY,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    user_id     BIGINT NOT NULL UNIQUE,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    bio         TEXT,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    avatar_url  VARCHAR(500),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    CONSTRAINT fk_user </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        FOREIGN KEY (user_id) REFERENCES users(user_id) </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>外键的级联策略直接影响数据维护行为：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>级联策略</th>\n<th>ON DELETE 行为</th>\n<th>ON UPDATE 行为</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CASCADE</td>\n<td>删除父行时同时删除子行</td>\n<td>更新父键时同步更新子键</td>\n<td>紧耦合关系（如用户-配置）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SET NULL</td>\n<td>子行外键设为 NULL</td>\n<td>子行外键设为 NULL</td>\n<td>松耦合关系（如文章-分类）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SET DEFAULT</td>\n<td>子行外键设为默认值</td>\n<td>子行外键设为默认值</td>\n<td>有默认归属的场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RESTRICT</td>\n<td>阻止删除</td>\n<td>阻止更新</td>\n<td>保护关键引用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NO ACTION</td>\n<td>延迟检查（事务结束时）</td>\n<td>延迟检查</td>\n<td>复杂事务中的灵活处理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"alter-与在线-ddl\">ALTER 与在线 DDL</h2><p>生产环境中的 DDL 变更需要特别谨慎。<code>ALTER TABLE</code> 在不同数据库中的行为差异很大——某些操作可能导致长时间的表锁定。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 安全的 ALTER 操作（大多数数据库中不锁表）&#10;const safeAlters = `&#10;ALTER TABLE users ADD COLUMN phone VARCHAR(20);&#10;ALTER TABLE users ALTER COLUMN phone SET DEFAULT &#39;&#39;;&#10;ALTER TABLE users ADD CONSTRAINT chk_phone CHECK (phone ~ &#39;^\\\\+?[0-9]{7,15}$&#39;);&#10;`;&#10;&#10;// 危险的 ALTER 操作（可能导致表重建/长时间锁）&#10;const riskyAlters = `&#10;ALTER TABLE users ALTER COLUMN username TYPE VARCHAR(100);  -- 类型变更可能重建表&#10;ALTER TABLE users ADD COLUMN score INT NOT NULL DEFAULT 0;  -- NOT NULL + DEFAULT 在大表上耗时&#10;`;&#10;&#10;// PostgreSQL 安全变更策略：分步操作&#10;const safeTypeChange = `&#10;-- 1. 添加新列&#10;ALTER TABLE users ADD COLUMN username_new VARCHAR(100);&#10;-- 2. 批量迁移数据（分批更新，避免长事务）&#10;UPDATE users SET username_new = username WHERE user_id BETWEEN 1 AND 10000;&#10;-- 3. 交换列（在低峰期）&#10;ALTER TABLE users DROP COLUMN username;&#10;ALTER TABLE users RENAME COLUMN username_new TO username;&#10;`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 安全的 ALTER 操作（大多数数据库中不锁表）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> safeAlters</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ALTER TABLE users ADD COLUMN phone VARCHAR(20);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ALTER TABLE users ALTER COLUMN phone SET DEFAULT '';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ALTER TABLE users ADD CONSTRAINT chk_phone CHECK (phone ~ '^</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\\</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">+?[0-9]{7,15}$');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 危险的 ALTER 操作（可能导致表重建/长时间锁）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> riskyAlters</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ALTER TABLE users ALTER COLUMN username TYPE VARCHAR(100);  -- 类型变更可能重建表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ALTER TABLE users ADD COLUMN score INT NOT NULL DEFAULT 0;  -- NOT NULL + DEFAULT 在大表上耗时</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// PostgreSQL 安全变更策略：分步操作</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> safeTypeChange</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 1. 添加新列</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ALTER TABLE users ADD COLUMN username_new VARCHAR(100);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 2. 批量迁移数据（分批更新，避免长事务）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">UPDATE users SET username_new = username WHERE user_id BETWEEN 1 AND 10000;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 3. 交换列（在低峰期）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ALTER TABLE users DROP COLUMN username;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ALTER TABLE users RENAME COLUMN username_new TO username;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>不同数据库对在线 DDL 的支持差异显著。MySQL 8.0+ 支持大部分 <code>ALGORITHM=INSTANT</code> 操作（如添加列到末尾），PostgreSQL 的 <code>ALTER TABLE ADD COLUMN</code> 如果有 DEFAULT 值在 11+ 版本中是即时操作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"identity-与序列\">IDENTITY 与序列</h2><p>自增 ID 的实现方式因数据库而异。传统的 <code>AUTO_INCREMENT</code>（MySQL）和 <code>SERIAL</code>（PostgreSQL 旧版）逐渐被 SQL 标准的 <code>GENERATED AS IDENTITY</code> 取代。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// SQL 标准方式（PostgreSQL 10+, SQL Server, DB2）&#10;const identityColumn = `&#10;CREATE TABLE events (&#10;    event_id BIGINT GENERATED ALWAYS AS IDENTITY PRIMARY KEY,&#10;    event_type VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL&#10;);&#10;`;&#10;&#10;// 显式序列管理（更灵活）&#10;const sequenceApproach = `&#10;CREATE SEQUENCE order_seq &#10;    START WITH 1000 &#10;    INCREMENT BY 1 &#10;    NO CYCLE &#10;    CACHE 20;&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE orders (&#10;    order_id BIGINT DEFAULT nextval(&#39;order_seq&#39;) PRIMARY KEY,&#10;    amount DECIMAL(12, 2) NOT NULL&#10;);&#10;`;&#10;&#10;// 分布式环境：自定义 ID 生成&#10;// 雪花算法等方案在应用层生成，数据库只存储 BIGINT\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// SQL 标准方式（PostgreSQL 10+, SQL Server, DB2）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> identityColumn</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">CREATE TABLE events (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    event_id BIGINT GENERATED ALWAYS AS IDENTITY PRIMARY KEY,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    event_type VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 显式序列管理（更灵活）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sequenceApproach</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">CREATE SEQUENCE order_seq </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    START WITH 1000 </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    INCREMENT BY 1 </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    NO CYCLE </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    CACHE 20;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">CREATE TABLE orders (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    order_id BIGINT DEFAULT nextval('order_seq') PRIMARY KEY,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    amount DECIMAL(12, 2) NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 分布式环境：自定义 ID 生成</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 雪花算法等方案在应用层生成，数据库只存储 BIGINT</span></span></code></pre></div><p>使用 <code>GENERATED ALWAYS</code> 而非 <code>GENERATED BY DEFAULT</code> 可以防止应用层意外覆盖 ID 值。序列的 CACHE 参数影响并发性能——值越大并发插入越快，但进程崩溃时可能产生 ID 间隙。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>数据类型选择直接影响存储效率、查询性能和数据正确性，金额字段必须使用 DECIMAL</li>\n<li>DDL 约束（PRIMARY KEY、FOREIGN KEY、CHECK、UNIQUE、NOT NULL）是数据完整性的数据库级防线</li>\n<li>外键级联策略（CASCADE、SET NULL、RESTRICT 等）决定了关联数据的维护行为</li>\n<li>生产环境 ALTER TABLE 需要评估锁影响，大表变更建议分步操作</li>\n<li>GENERATED AS IDENTITY 是 SQL 标准的自增方案，优于传统的 AUTO_INCREMENT / SERIAL</li>\n<li>序列的 CACHE 参数在并发性能和 ID 连续性之间做权衡</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"数据类型与 DDL","id":"数据类型与-ddl"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"数值类型精度选择","id":"数值类型精度选择"},{"level":2,"text":"表创建与约束体系","id":"表创建与约束体系"},{"level":2,"text":"ALTER 与在线 DDL","id":"alter-与在线-ddl"},{"level":2,"text":"IDENTITY 与序列","id":"identity-与序列"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"SELECT 查询基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/sql-language/sql-fundamentals/select-fundamentals"}}